# Phase 4 nested-2 validation : yband_h_full layout with ratio=4
# (automatic 2:1 cascading -> 2 levels). Mode 0 production.

Simulation amr_d_couette_yband_h_full_nested2 D2Q9

Define U = 0.05
Define omega = 1.0
Define rho0 = 1.0

Domain L = 16 x 12  N = 16 x 12
Physics nu = 0.16666666666666666

Boundary west periodic
Boundary east periodic
Boundary south wall
Boundary north velocity(ux = 0.05, uy = 0)

Refine yband_h_full { region = [0, 4, 16, 8], ratio = 4 }

Run 200 steps
Diagnostics every 100 [step, ux, uy, rho, mass]
